{"id":"624298","name":"包菜香芋饺","author":"清水淡竹","authorId":"8451954","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/624298/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"夹心肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香芋","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"花椒","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"葱姜、花椒加水浸泡。","img":"images/624298/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"夹心肉剁成肉末，加盐、料酒、生抽、耗油、葱姜水拌匀。","img":"images/624298/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"包菜清洗干净。","img":"images/624298/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"包菜搅细，加盐搓软。","img":"images/624298/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"挤去水分。","img":"images/624298/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"香芋切细丁。","img":"images/624298/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅中放油，放入香芋丁炒至八分熟。","img":"images/624298/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"肉末、香芋、包菜拌匀成馅。","img":"images/624298/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"饺子皮取适量馅。","img":"images/624298/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"包好饺子。","img":"images/624298/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"锅中放水烧开，加点盐，放入饺子烧煮，中途点两遍冷水。","img":"images/624298/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"生抽、陈醋、葱花放入碗中。","img":"images/624298/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"盛入饺子。","img":"images/624298/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}